    <string name="registro_eula_contenido_terminos">TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF USE&#10;Version 1.0 - Effective from June 1, 2025&#10;&#10;1. ACCEPTANCE&#10;By creating a MoveOn account, you fully accept these Terms. If you do not agree, do not use the application.&#10;&#10;2. MINIMUM AGE&#10;MoveOn is intended exclusively for people over 18 years old. By registering, you declare that you meet this requirement. We reserve the right to cancel accounts that do not comply with this condition.&#10;&#10;3. SERVICE DESCRIPTION&#10;MoveOn is an application for registering and tracking physical activity, including routes, distances and personal statistics. The service is provided as is and may change or be interrupted at any time.&#10;&#10;4. USER ACCOUNT&#10;You are responsible for keeping your credentials confidential and for all activity carried out from your account. Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use.&#10;&#10;5. ACCEPTABLE USE&#10;The following is prohibited: (a) using the application for illegal purposes; (b) attempting to access other users\' data; © reverse engineering the software; (d) publishing offensive or false content.&#10;&#10;6. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY&#10;All rights related to MoveOn, including design, source code and trademark, belong to their respective owners. No license is granted beyond personal and non-commercial use of the application.&#10;&#10;7. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY&#10;MoveOn does not guarantee the accuracy of activity data or its suitability for medical or professional sports purposes. We are not liable for damages arising from the use of the application.&#10;&#10;8. MODIFICATIONS&#10;We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use implies acceptance of the new Terms.&#10;&#10;9. APPLICABLE LAW&#10;These Terms are governed by Spanish law.&#10;&#10;10. CONTACT&#10;For any questions about these Terms, write to us at: info.moveon.app@gmail.com</string>
    <string name="registro_eula_contenido_politica">PRIVACY POLICY&#10;Version 1.0 - Effective from June 1, 2025&#10;&#10;Data controller: MoveOn App&#10;Contact: privacidad@moveon.app&#10;&#10;1. DATA WE COLLECT&#10;- Account data: username, email address, encrypted password and date of birth.&#10;- Activity data: GPS routes, distances, times and exercise statistics.&#10;- Legal acceptance data: date and version of acceptance of these terms, required for GDPR compliance.&#10;- Technical data: device model, operating system version and session identifiers.&#10;&#10;2. PURPOSE AND LEGAL BASIS&#10;We process your data to: (a) provide the activity tracking service - performance of a contract under Article 6.1(b) GDPR; (b) improve the application using aggregated statistics - legitimate interest under Article 6.1(f) GDPR; © comply with legal obligations under Article 6.1© GDPR.&#10;&#10;3. LOCATION DATA&#10;MoveOn accesses your GPS location only while you are recording an activity and with your explicit consent. Route data is stored on our servers to show your history. You can delete any route from the application itself.&#10;&#10;4. RETENTION&#10;We keep your data while you maintain an active account. After account deletion, the data is removed within a maximum period of 30 days, unless legal retention is required.&#10;&#10;5. RECIPIENTS&#10;We do not sell your data to third parties. We may share it with infrastructure providers, including hosting within the European Union, under data processing agreements compliant with GDPR.&#10;&#10;6. YOUR RIGHTS&#10;You have the right to access, rectify, erase, object and request portability of your data. You can exercise these rights by writing to privacidad@moveon.app. You may also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency at aepd.es.&#10;&#10;7. SECURITY&#10;We apply TLS encryption to all communications and store passwords using secure hashing algorithms such as bcrypt. We adopt technical and organizational measures to protect your data.&#10;&#10;8. MINORS&#10;MoveOn is not intended for persons under 18 years old and we do not knowingly collect data from minors. If we detect an account belonging to a minor, we will delete it immediately.&#10;&#10;9. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY&#10;We will notify any relevant changes through the application at least 15 days in advance.&#10;&#10;10. CONTACT&#10;To exercise your rights or resolve questions, contact: info.moveon.app@gmail.com</string>
